  "raw_label": "appellant_won",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M.Chandramohan vs The Commissioner Of Food Safety on 23 July, 2024 W.P.(MD)No.16941 to Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated : 23.07.2024 Coram The Honourable Ms Justice R.N.Manjula W.P.(MD)Nos.16941 to 16948 of 2024 and W.M.P.(MD)Nos.14596, 14598, 14607, 14609, 14602, 14603, 14599, 14600 of 2024 M.Chandramohan ... Petitioner in W.P.(Md) 16941 S.Rajkumar ... Petitioner in W.P.(Md) 16942 K.Sabar Sathik ... Petitioner in W.P.(Md) 16943 M.Sankaranarayanan ... Petitioner in W.P.(Md) 16944 Vs. The Commissioner of Food Safety and Drug Administration, O/o.the Commissioner of Food safety and Drug Administration, Dms Campus, Annasalai, Chennai-600 006. ... Respondents in all pet COMMON PRAYER: Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of India for issuance of Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus to call for the pertaining to the impugned order of transfer in R.No.3958/2024/S12/FSD, 19.07.2024 on the file of the respondent and quash the same as illegal a https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/6 W.P.(MD)No.1",
    "facts": "5.The grievance of the petitioners is that the petitioners herein are working as Food Safety Officers in different districts and in the name of rationalization, without any guidelines or counseling, simply by way of pick and choose method, the transfer orders have been passed transferring the petitioners from one district to another district.",
    "arguments": "6.The learned Additional Government Pleader for the respondent submitted that there are some shortages of Food Safety Officers in certain Districts and hence, rationalization had been made by equally distributing the officers in the cadre of Food Safety Officers to various districts. The transfer orders have been made purely on administrative contingency taking into consideration of the deficiencies in certain districts. He further submitted that the recruitment made to fill up the vacancies of Food Safety Officers have been put to challenge by some of the candidates and hence, the vacancies in the said posts could not be filled up."
  },
