      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "39e88aeac1634591abbdece9161f5e7f_20",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n8.No doubt, the administrative contingency should rise up first."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "853075109c164c40889bff05a74b2817_21",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There should not be any vacancies in the post of Food Safety Officers."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "01eac78ca4fe49c29bdd847e6b292184_22",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, there should be some scheme or method to be adopted for effecting such transfers for rationalizing the services of the Officers."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "6a827a5519b6427fbb1b336a64a189c7_23",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
